  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide water for Indonesian villages</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The global warming phenomena has caused changes, good or bad, to weather and climate all over the world. Locations impacted negatively include several regions of Indonesia, which are currently experiencing unprecedented drought. Such conditions create water shortage which in turn will impact food availability and health of communities.  In response, Rumah Zakat Indonesia is launching the water well program to help provide water-acquiring facilities for villages experiencing drought.</narrative>
  </description>
